<title>USA: BDM Intl boosts authorized shrs.</title>
<headline>BDM Intl boosts authorized shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BDM International Inc said on Friday that its shareholders voted to increase the number of authorized shares to 100 million from 50 million.</p>
<p>BDM has approximately 30 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
